Actually, if you put a search in quotes it will search for that specific 
expression and not just word1 AND word2 AND word3 etc...
So when xorxes said that he got 50,500,000 hits for "I hear you ask" (it's up to 
50,700,000 now for me) he means that that specific expression comes up that many 
times not just pages containing all those words.

And all results on the first page are close fits for the usage that xorxes 
describes.


